**/ios/**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.m

# Windows Masaüstü
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/windows/**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.cc
**/windows/**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.h

# Web
**/web/build/

